        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbit and touch! A star-orbiting action game — Suite: Pictures at an Exhibition!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is this game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・An action game built around the piano suite &quot;Pictures at an Exhibition&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Join little Pechka on a journey through souls that have become stars!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>Only left and right controls!</strong> Orbit around the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>The stars release two types of orbs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　・<strong>Light Orbs are joy!</strong> Touch them to return joy to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　・<strong>Shadow Orbs are sorrow!</strong> Avoid touching them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Fill the stars with joy before each piece ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　<strong>Will you fill all the stars…?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The title of this game was changed in February 2026 (formerly &quot;88 at an Exhibition&quot;).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Gameplay videos and livestreams are welcome. No prior permission is required.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbit and touch! A star-orbiting action game — Suite: Pictures at an Exhibition!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is this game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・An action game built around the piano suite &quot;Pictures at an Exhibition&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Join little Pechka on a journey through souls that have become stars!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>Only left and right controls!</strong> Orbit around the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>The stars release two types of orbs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　・<strong>Light Orbs are joy!</strong> Touch them to return joy to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　・<strong>Shadow Orbs are sorrow!</strong> Avoid touching them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Fill the stars with joy before each piece ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　<strong>Will you fill all the stars…?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The title of this game was changed in February 2026 (formerly &quot;88 at an Exhibition&quot;).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Gameplay videos and livestreams are welcome. No prior permission is required.</p>",
